# Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs. Keeps secrets, data/, tests,
# firmware and node_modules out of the build context. Add a path here when
# adding a COPY to the Dockerfile.
*
!requirements.txt
!nginx.conf
!supervisord.conf
!frontend/hvac-dashboard.html
!frontend/kiosk.html
!*.py
!routers/
routers/__pycache__/
